<p>Launch yourself toward a target. If the target is reached you get a free attack doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">112%, 138%, 158%, 175%, 190%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>If the attack hits you release a massive burst of fire in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 3, 4, 4,</acronym> knocking away all enemies except your target and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">114, 154, 185, 211, 234</acronym> damage.</p><p>You must charge from at least 2 tiles away.</p>